        "translator": "K. M. K. Murthy / Desiraju Hanumanta Rao",
        "text": "On listening all those words of Valmiki, Narada, the knower of all the three worlds, said \"let it be heard...\" and beckoning at Sage Valmiki to listen attentively, he spoke these words very gladly. [1-1-6]"
